              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oidha kundeeteranga ebigheebwayo ku birime by'osooka okukungula, ni ku muzigo ogw'emiti emyoliva gy'okamula, ni ku mwenge gw'emizabbibu gw'okunha. Era oidha kumpanga omwana omulenzi anaasookanga okuzaalibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
